<title>USA: Belden sets $50.8 mln capital budget.</title>
<headline>Belden sets $50.8 mln capital budget.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH CANTON, Ohio 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belden &amp; Blake Corp said on Wednesday its 1997 capital budget will be $50.8 million, up from $38.1 million in 1996.</p>
<p>The 1997 budget includes $38 million to drill 250 wells, and $3 million for additional leasehold acquisitions.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
